    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-menhirkin=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"The first shape was softer. The second shape remembers.\"</em></p>\n<p><strong>The Thing You Were (1/Scene).</strong> Bonus action — briefly re-surface a trait of your pre-pressure self. Pick one of three options; it lasts until the end of your next turn:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Softer:</strong> your movement increases by 2 squares and you reroll the lowest die on Intrigue checks to squeeze or slip past.</li>\n  <li><strong>Older:</strong> you gain low-light vision 12 squares if you don't already have it, or +6 squares if you do.</li>\n  <li><strong>Wetter:</strong> you become immune to the Burning and Prone conditions, and difficult terrain does not slow you.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Each option refreshes on Soma Break — you cannot pick the same option twice before a Soma Break.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"menhirkinMetamorphicThingYouWere\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>The Thing You Were</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Scene total — each option refreshes on Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Picker (Softer · Older · Wetter) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Bonus action — re-surface one of three pre-pressure traits (Softer / Older / Wetter) until end of next turn. Each option's individual use refreshes on Soma Break.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
